    "title": "Lab 3.2",
    "section": "Recomendations:",
    "text": "Recomendations:\nBased on feedback from my classmates, I made several changes to improve the clarity and readability of the analysis. The original charts were seen as too complex, so I removed log-scaled axes and smoothing lines to make the numbers easier to understand.\nI also added clearer titles, axis labels, and legends so it is easy to identify which variables represent Fresh and Milk spending. The final chart focuses on a simple and direct comparison that can be understood at a quick glance.\nOverall, these changes helped make the visualizations cleaner, easier to read, and more effective in communicating the main insights to a general audience."
